OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly
OL,6,Fcloudy night with light and patchy
OL,7,Frain slowly clearing to the south. A
OL,8,Flittle rain lingering over parts of
OL,9,FArgyll and Ayrshire by the end of the
OL,10,Fnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FAny rain clearing to the
OL,13,Fsouth leaving a mostly dry day with
OL,14,Fbright and sunny spells developing
OL,15,Ffrom the north. Breezy around coasts
OL,16,Fat first but easing later.
OL,17,
OL,18,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FIt will
OL,19,Fbe dry and cold on Friday and Saturday
OL,20,Fwith long sunny spells and overnight
OL,21,Ffrost. Dry on Sunday.
